WEBVTT

00:19.791 --> 00:23.125
<i>What do you want to talk about, Klara?
Where do you want to begin?</i>

00:24.208 --> 00:25.416
<i>I don't know.</i>

00:25.500 --> 00:28.333
<i>Okay. If you aren't going
to begin, I will.</i>

00:30.125 --> 00:33.708
<i>Let's see. When was the last time
you left the house? Do you remember?</i>

00:37.083 --> 00:38.083
<i>Well...</i>

00:41.291 --> 00:42.416
August 12th.

00:43.916 --> 00:45.541
Today makes 76 days at home.

00:46.958 --> 00:48.458
Isn't there anything you miss?

00:53.500 --> 00:55.083
<i>I really miss traveling.</i>

00:55.833 --> 00:58.500
<i>The last time I did it,
I went to the beach with my family.</i>

01:01.791 --> 01:03.125
I laughed a lot, actually.

01:13.291 --> 01:16.458
<i>Or with my mother.
The day that it snowed a lot.</i>

01:17.041 --> 01:18.625
<i>Before she died.</i>

01:20.041 --> 01:20.875
<i>But...</i>

01:21.541 --> 01:22.458
But?

01:24.083 --> 01:25.291
But...

01:25.375 --> 01:26.375
But what?

01:29.250 --> 01:32.833
I don't miss how bad I felt
during my last month of school.

01:35.916 --> 01:37.083
<i>How they looked at me,</i>

01:37.916 --> 01:40.000
the people I had thought were my friends.

01:43.041 --> 01:44.750
Or the hours in the hospitals,

01:45.541 --> 01:46.583
<i>the waiting,</i>

01:47.916 --> 01:49.208
<i>the bad news.</i>

01:56.250 --> 01:59.000
I know I'm missing out on a lot
by staying in my house.

02:02.208 --> 02:04.750
But I also feel protected here
from lots of other things.

02:04.833 --> 02:05.833
<i>Right.</i>

02:09.416 --> 02:12.833
<i>I understand.
Feeling safe is very important.</i>

02:15.041 --> 02:16.958
<i>That's how I feel with my family.</i>

02:17.041 --> 02:20.541
How was therapy? Did you tell him
how your new medication is going?

02:21.166 --> 02:22.666
- K2.
- What?

02:23.750 --> 02:26.500
As a psychiatrist, I give you a 7,
but as an annoying sister, a 10.

02:26.583 --> 02:27.750
Okay, whatever.

02:27.833 --> 02:30.875
Hey, isn't it time
for your date with your sweetheart?

02:30.958 --> 02:33.500
- Leave her alone. Don't tease her.
- With your sweetheart?

02:33.583 --> 02:36.875
<i>Even if my sister and her boyfriend
are a little nosy.</i>

02:37.750 --> 02:39.208
- Are you nervous?
- Stop it!

02:39.291 --> 02:40.875
Don't say stuff like that to her.

02:40.958 --> 02:41.958
I hate you both, okay?

02:42.041 --> 02:45.208
<i>So, there is something
that gets you a little bit excited.</i>

02:45.916 --> 02:47.083
<i>There is.</i>

02:47.166 --> 02:50.083
<i>Well, someone I listen to every night.</i>

02:50.791 --> 02:53.625
<i>He's got a sort of radio show.</i>

02:54.208 --> 02:55.416
<i>Hi, everyone.</i>

02:55.500 --> 02:58.500
<i>Thanks for listening
and for being with me here tonight.</i>

02:59.000 --> 03:01.041
<i>This is</i> Follow My Voice,

03:01.125 --> 03:05.166
<i>and I'm Kang, your companion
and your friend for the next hour.</i>

03:06.625 --> 03:10.916
<i>Today's topic is something you've all
asked me about many times: love.</i>

03:12.958 --> 03:14.500
<i>Have you ever been in love?</i>

03:15.458 --> 03:17.125
<i>Did they break your heart?</i>

03:17.208 --> 03:19.625
<i>If so, don't worry.</i>

03:19.708 --> 03:24.291
<i>Time heals all, and you will meet someone
who will make you very happy.</i>

03:25.333 --> 03:26.333
<i>Like I always say...</i>

03:26.416 --> 03:29.208
"We have to learn from the bad,
and turn the page..."

03:29.291 --> 03:30.333
<i>...to move on.</i>

03:32.708 --> 03:35.416
<i>I think a lot about writing to him, but...</i>

03:36.208 --> 03:37.291
<i>I don't know.</i>

03:37.375 --> 03:40.625
<i>I'm sure he gets tons of messages
and he won't even read mine.</i>

03:40.708 --> 03:41.791
<i>You don't know that.</i>

03:42.708 --> 03:43.875
<i>He might answer you.</i>

03:44.666 --> 03:45.666
Do you think so?

03:46.541 --> 03:47.833
<i>Of course.</i>

03:51.541 --> 03:53.458
<i>Alicia asks, "Are you Korean?"</i>

03:54.250 --> 03:55.500
<i>Yes, I was born in Seoul,</i>

03:55.583 --> 03:58.041
<i>but I have been living in Spain
for the past five years.</i>

03:59.083 --> 04:00.916
<i>"When are you going to show your face?"</i>

04:01.000 --> 04:02.875
<i>You already know that embarrasses me.</i>

04:03.541 --> 04:06.375
<i>Someday, I will dare
to reveal my identity.</i>

04:10.125 --> 04:13.833
<i>Today, I asked you guys
about your happiest moments,</i>

04:14.500 --> 04:17.708
<i>and I got a message
that really touched me.</i>

04:19.333 --> 04:23.375
<i>It's a photo of a painting,
a snowy landscape.</i>

04:24.625 --> 04:29.166
<i>I know that place because I went there
with someone very special to me.</i>

04:32.458 --> 04:36.666
<i>Thanks, K. I hope you can
keep on enjoying that place,</i>

04:36.750 --> 04:39.416
<i>even if you miss having
that important someone by your side.</i>

04:40.625 --> 04:41.625
<i>I do.</i>

04:43.000 --> 04:45.041
<i>I don't know
if I'll be able to go back there.</i>

04:45.125 --> 04:46.791
<i>That's why we're here, aren't we?</i>

04:48.125 --> 04:50.250
<i>To keep taking tiny steps every day,</i>

04:51.291 --> 04:52.750
<i>and the first one...</i>

04:53.708 --> 04:56.416
<i>is to try... You say it.</i>

04:59.458 --> 05:00.708
To go out into the world.

05:37.958 --> 05:44.958
FOLLOW MY VOICE

05:50.083 --> 05:56.083
1. GO OUT INTO THE WORLD

06:03.916 --> 06:05.291
Hi

06:05.375 --> 06:08.000
Hi

06:12.875 --> 06:15.250
How are you?

06:18.125 --> 06:20.416
Who is this?

06:20.500 --> 06:21.791
Kang

06:27.083 --> 06:30.958
Kang? From Follow My Voice?

06:32.750 --> 06:33.583
Of course hahaha

06:36.000 --> 06:37.375
How many Kangs do you know?

06:56.500 --> 06:58.666
Sorry for bothering
I love the picture you sent me

06:58.750 --> 07:00.833
I noticed it was signed with a K
Did you paint it?

07:00.916 --> 07:01.750
Yes

07:08.041 --> 07:10.041
That's so cool!

07:10.125 --> 07:13.750
But... Hang on! How do I know it's you?

07:16.416 --> 07:19.375
<i>Come on, then, test me.</i>

07:25.541 --> 07:27.250
Okay. Uh...

07:27.333 --> 07:31.375
On tonight's show,
you have to say a code word.

07:33.333 --> 07:35.791
You have to say "cheese."

07:43.625 --> 07:45.000
<i>I miss food.</i>

07:45.083 --> 07:47.750
<i>Well, my friends and family more.</i>

07:48.291 --> 07:50.958
<i>Someday I hope I can go back
and live there again.</i>

07:51.916 --> 07:53.791
<i>Well, that's it for today,</i>

07:53.875 --> 07:57.083
<i>but before the end of</i> Follow My Voice,
<i>I want to tell something about myself.</i>

07:58.791 --> 08:00.583
<i>I totally love cheese.</i>

08:01.541 --> 08:03.250
<i>See you tomorrow.</i>

08:03.333 --> 08:05.583
<i>I'm going to leave you
with a very special song</i>

08:05.666 --> 08:07.250
<i>for a very special person.</i>

08:08.208 --> 08:12.916
<i>Whoever you are,
I can't wait to solve your mystery, K.</i>

09:31.958 --> 09:32.958
Kang.

10:01.791 --> 10:04.583
<i>Do you believe me now
or do I have to do something else?</i>

10:13.625 --> 10:14.791
Well, for now, yeah.

10:15.916 --> 10:17.375
But...

10:19.041 --> 10:21.458
We'll see
if I need anything else from you.

10:24.041 --> 10:26.375
- Come on, honey. We won't make it.
- I'm coming.

10:29.458 --> 10:30.625
- Leaving already?
- Yeah.

10:30.708 --> 10:32.416
Well, if your sister hurries up,

10:32.500 --> 10:34.500
because this hot dog
is going to end up frozen.

10:35.208 --> 10:36.958
Very cute. You're so handsome.

10:37.541 --> 10:38.375
Come on, let's go.

10:38.458 --> 10:39.666
What time will you be back?

10:39.750 --> 10:41.583
Well, uh, 1:30.

10:41.666 --> 10:42.625
- Early, right?
- 2:00?

10:42.708 --> 10:44.458
- 1:30. Yeah.
- 1:30.

10:44.541 --> 10:47.583
You can come too as the mustard.
The three of us can go together.

10:48.208 --> 10:50.166
To a Halloween party
full of 30-somethings?

10:51.000 --> 10:53.166
Uh... How about... no.

10:53.916 --> 10:54.833
Wow.

10:55.916 --> 10:56.750
Okay, then.

10:56.833 --> 10:59.041
I'm asking
in case you don't want to be alone.

10:59.125 --> 11:00.208
No, I'm fine.

11:00.291 --> 11:01.333
- Are you sure?
- Yeah.

11:01.416 --> 11:02.458
- Okay, it's fine.
- Okay.

11:02.541 --> 11:04.458
- Look, it's your loss, okay?
- It's my loss.

11:04.541 --> 11:06.375
- Sure?
- Leave her alone. With 30-somethings...

11:06.458 --> 11:08.125
Call us if you need anything.

11:08.208 --> 11:10.208
- Call us and we'll be here.
- Of course, come on.

11:10.291 --> 11:11.583
- Bye.
- Bye, K.

11:11.666 --> 11:13.458
- I love you.
- Bye. Have fun.

11:14.083 --> 11:16.083
- Come.
- I can't get by if you don't move.

11:16.166 --> 11:17.541
- Okay, I'm going.
- Okay.

11:48.500 --> 11:50.666
I'M NOT GOING TO GET BETTER

11:50.750 --> 11:54.958
I'M NEVER GOING TO LEAVE THE HOUSE

11:55.041 --> 12:01.166
I'M ALONE

12:01.250 --> 12:07.125
I CAN'T BREATHE
IT'S A PANIC ATTACK

12:22.625 --> 12:23.916
- Hello?
<i>- Hello?</i>

12:24.916 --> 12:26.583
I'M GOING TO DIE
WHAT HAVE I DONE?

12:26.666 --> 12:28.416
IT'S KANG
HE'S GOING TO KNOW THAT I'M SICK

12:28.500 --> 12:31.958
<i>-Calm, calm.</i>
- Sorry, I wanted to call my sister.

12:32.041 --> 12:33.541
<i>What's wrong? Are you okay?</i>

12:35.750 --> 12:37.666
No. I can't breathe.

12:38.166 --> 12:39.166
<i>Where are you?</i>

12:44.541 --> 12:45.958
<i>Calm...</i>

12:46.041 --> 12:48.041
I CAN'T BREATHE
I'M NOT OKAY

12:48.125 --> 12:49.333
KANG, PLEASE HELP ME

12:49.416 --> 12:52.500
<i>I'm here. With you.</i>

12:57.041 --> 12:59.791
<i>Okay, we're going to think
about something else.</i>

13:01.083 --> 13:02.916
<i>We're going to think about something nice.</i>

13:05.166 --> 13:07.583
<i>I think it's going to snow next week.</i>

13:08.791 --> 13:11.208
<i>Have you ever watched how the snow falls?</i>

13:16.291 --> 13:18.583
<i>It's as if it's dancing.</i>

13:22.208 --> 13:24.916
<i>Every time a snowflake falls, breathe.</i>

13:39.833 --> 13:42.333
<i>Every time a snowflake falls, breathe.</i>

14:15.291 --> 14:16.458
<i>Are you feeling better?</i>

14:26.541 --> 14:29.000
I'm sorry, I have to hang up.

14:49.125 --> 14:49.958
K.

14:53.833 --> 14:55.083
Do you want something to eat?

14:56.500 --> 14:57.500
No.

14:59.375 --> 15:00.500
I just want to sleep.

15:01.083 --> 15:02.791
You've been in bed for days, K.

15:06.750 --> 15:07.958
Do you want...

15:10.208 --> 15:13.333
Do you want us to put on Kang's show?
It's going to start soon.

15:14.666 --> 15:16.041
- No?
- No.

15:19.083 --> 15:21.666
K. Listen.

15:23.458 --> 15:27.708
Even though this happened, I swear,
I swear to you that it's going to be okay.

15:27.791 --> 15:29.291
Everything's going to be okay.

15:37.500 --> 15:38.500
I promise.

15:52.208 --> 15:54.250
<i>- Are you sure?
- Are you looking or not?</i>

16:05.916 --> 16:07.750
Look how far your sister got.

16:18.458 --> 16:19.916
I'm okay!

16:20.000 --> 16:21.666
One! Two!

16:21.750 --> 16:23.750
- Three!
- Yeah!

16:28.291 --> 16:30.000
Mom!

16:32.458 --> 16:36.250
<i>We have to do things now.
We don't know where we'll be tomorrow.</i>

16:36.333 --> 16:38.958
<i>Besides, who knows
when it will snow like this again.</i>

16:40.375 --> 16:41.500
Wow!

16:41.583 --> 16:43.166
<i>I loved it!</i>

16:43.791 --> 16:46.083
<i>- Again?
- Again!</i>

16:49.125 --> 16:54.666
It's terrible. Terrible. It's my fault.

16:54.750 --> 16:57.125
- It's my fault.
- It wasn't your fault.

16:57.208 --> 17:00.708
- Yes. I shouldn't have left her alone.
- This would have happened at any time.

17:00.791 --> 17:03.083
- No, it's my fault.
- It has nothing to do with you.

17:08.625 --> 17:11.083
- It's okay.
- I shouldn't have left her alone.

17:12.375 --> 17:15.083
It's my fault, Andy, it's my fault.

17:17.458 --> 17:18.666
K2.

17:21.333 --> 17:22.541
It's not your fault.

17:30.125 --> 17:31.083
I want to try.

17:34.666 --> 17:36.416
I want to try to go back to school.

17:38.083 --> 17:41.250
I want to try to have a life again...
like before.

17:45.208 --> 17:46.208
Really?

18:07.791 --> 18:09.166
Come on, K. You can do it.

18:10.208 --> 18:11.125
Yeah.

18:22.125 --> 18:25.625
They walked with me for a few blocks and...

18:25.708 --> 18:27.833
then I went the rest of the way alone.

18:29.916 --> 18:31.041
That's great, right?

18:32.166 --> 18:34.250
I'm so pleased. That is excellent news.

18:42.833 --> 18:45.458
<i>I have a map in my room.</i>

18:48.208 --> 18:50.666
<i>And I want to color in
every place I manage to go.</i>

18:52.958 --> 18:54.041
I like it.

18:55.541 --> 18:58.666
In no time at all,
you'll be going off that map. You'll see.

19:15.625 --> 19:18.583
That's it. There it is.

19:18.666 --> 19:21.625
Very good! You've done it. Very good!

19:22.750 --> 19:23.916
I knew you could do it.

19:31.291 --> 19:33.875
<i>So? Nervous about tomorrow?</i>

19:34.541 --> 19:36.666
<i>A little. Yeah.</i>

19:39.791 --> 19:41.875
- A lot.
- It's normal.

19:41.958 --> 19:44.333
We all get nervous
when we go to a new place.

19:46.166 --> 19:47.166
Yeah... Yes.

19:48.583 --> 19:49.833
Klara.

19:49.916 --> 19:52.625
It's just that since I had
those bad days, you know?

19:53.250 --> 19:55.166
I'm afraid that it'll happen again.

20:06.125 --> 20:08.250
No matter what... You know where I am.

20:08.333 --> 20:10.208
- Okay?
- Yeah. Go on.

20:11.166 --> 20:13.250
What if I can't manage
to go to class tomorrow?

20:13.333 --> 20:16.708
Well, if you don't manage tomorrow,
you'll have a chance to go the day after.

20:17.583 --> 20:21.750
<i>And if not that day, then the next.
And if not, then the next.</i>

20:27.625 --> 20:29.916
<i>And that's how you'll build
your daily life bit by bit.</i>

20:53.125 --> 21:00.083
2. BUILD YOUR DAILY LIFE

21:19.750 --> 21:20.791
Hoodie.

21:25.083 --> 21:26.958
Hoodie, new girl, I'm talking to you.

21:34.375 --> 21:36.333
Aren't you going to introduce yourself?

21:37.125 --> 21:38.708
You rather I call you "Hoodie."

21:41.125 --> 21:42.625
And you're mute too.

21:45.416 --> 21:46.916
I'm Klara, with a K.

21:48.416 --> 21:51.375
K-Hoodie with a K.
I'm Diego. Nice to meet you.

21:52.875 --> 21:53.875
Okay.

21:57.250 --> 21:59.625
A truly captivating conversation, huh?

22:08.333 --> 22:11.500
<i>Please, get some
of the soccer team's raffle tickets.</i>

22:12.250 --> 22:15.250
<i>- We need new uniforms.
- Dude, hurry up.</i>

22:15.333 --> 22:17.916
<i>If we keep on like this,
we'll end up playing naked.</i>

22:18.625 --> 22:19.458
<i>Go on, run.</i>

22:20.416 --> 22:21.416
Kang.

22:29.208 --> 22:30.125
Hey.

22:31.666 --> 22:33.291
Who was that on the loudspeaker?

22:34.833 --> 22:36.333
The annoying Kang, yeah.

22:41.791 --> 22:46.000
Good morning, guys. Open your books
to section 3, where we left off yesterday.

22:49.416 --> 22:51.833
- Where is he?
- How's the exam going?

22:52.458 --> 22:54.875
As soon as I get home, I have to study.

22:56.708 --> 22:58.541
Give me your notes. Come on, please.

22:59.041 --> 22:59.958
What do you mean?

23:05.583 --> 23:07.458
- I have to study.
- What about tonight?

23:07.541 --> 23:09.583
Tonight... I want to study.

23:27.000 --> 23:29.041
- I'm a little confused.
- Yeah? Why?

23:29.125 --> 23:31.458
The girl I was talking to
hasn't written me in days.

23:31.541 --> 23:33.458
- Okay, how many days?
- Six.

23:34.291 --> 23:37.041
Dude, just six days.
That's not a big deal.

23:37.583 --> 23:39.250
Actually... nine.

23:39.333 --> 23:41.250
What, what, what? Did I hear that right?

23:41.333 --> 23:44.416
Nine days? Forget her. The message
is loud and clear: not interested.

23:44.500 --> 23:46.458
Diego, shut up already.
You're such a downer.

23:46.541 --> 23:49.666
Okay, but I'm just saying it
so the poor kid can chill out a bit.

23:49.750 --> 23:52.166
Thanks, Diego, but nobody asked you. So...

23:52.250 --> 23:53.250
You're welcome, Kang.

23:55.916 --> 23:56.750
Open!

24:10.250 --> 24:11.333
Hi, Min Seo!

24:14.125 --> 24:15.250
Brother!

24:17.375 --> 24:19.041
Come on, don't get distracted.

24:27.000 --> 24:28.125
You got this wrong.

24:28.833 --> 24:30.208
Dad, we made a mistake!

24:30.291 --> 24:31.125
Let me see.

24:33.041 --> 24:33.916
Well...

24:34.708 --> 24:36.541
your brother had better help you.

24:37.125 --> 24:40.041
Yeah, I'd better.
This isn't your thing either.

24:56.375 --> 24:58.666
When will you guys stop arguing?

24:58.750 --> 25:00.125
We weren't arguing.

25:00.208 --> 25:01.833
It's always the same.

25:02.875 --> 25:05.250
Don't worry about that.
Let's keep drawing...

25:05.833 --> 25:06.708
<i>Hi, folks!</i>

25:06.791 --> 25:08.625
<i>This is</i> Follow My Voice,

25:08.708 --> 25:12.458
<i>and I'm Kang, your companion
and friend for the next hour.</i>

25:13.041 --> 25:16.750
Guys, I've been pretty sad
the last few days.

25:20.958 --> 25:24.708
So I'm going to play a song
that always makes me forget my problems

25:25.250 --> 25:27.166
and gives me the urge to go out again.

25:28.083 --> 25:29.666
I hope you do the same.

25:42.250 --> 25:43.583
- Hi.
- Hi, Yana.

25:45.666 --> 25:46.791
You're not dancing?

25:48.250 --> 25:50.000
Come on, don't be a bore.

25:53.583 --> 25:54.541
Is everything okay?

25:57.750 --> 25:58.958
Everything is... better.

26:02.791 --> 26:04.125
Wanna hit the dance floor?

26:05.083 --> 26:07.583
Uh... Sure, sure.

26:37.875 --> 26:41.541
Kang, I'm sorry for having disappeared.

26:42.916 --> 26:47.083
<i>Well, it's just that I've had
a strange few days.</i>

26:47.958 --> 26:51.625
<i>But anyway... I wanted to say thank you.</i>

26:54.791 --> 26:56.583
<i>Listening to your voice helps me a lot.</i>

27:04.833 --> 27:06.708
<i>Is the "K" for Kandy,</i>

27:06.791 --> 27:09.208
<i>- for Katerina, for Kasilda?</i>
- Don't move.

27:11.708 --> 27:14.041
For... Klara

27:15.750 --> 27:17.208
You guys are so annoying.

27:19.958 --> 27:22.833
<i>How can I paint your portrait
if you're the boy without a face?</i>

27:27.583 --> 27:31.958
<i>I use it so nobody recognizes me
when I sing at a bar downtown.</i>

27:32.041 --> 27:35.666
Well, that's cheating.
It doesn't count if I can't see your face.

27:35.750 --> 27:38.750
<i>Don't laugh, okay? Now you know my secret.</i>

27:40.458 --> 27:42.208
<i>Don't worry, I won't tell anyone...</i>

27:43.333 --> 27:44.666
<i>Batkang.</i>

27:47.416 --> 27:50.875
NEW TALENT
COMPETITION

27:50.958 --> 27:53.500
<i>You're going to think I'm a bit intense,</i>

27:53.583 --> 27:56.583
<i>but you've inspired me,
and I'm writing a new song.</i>

27:57.750 --> 28:00.416
<i>I don't know if it's any good,
but whatever.</i>

28:00.500 --> 28:03.291
<i>There's a competition,
and I want to participate.</i>

28:03.375 --> 28:05.250
<i>Let's see if I can do something cool.</i>

28:14.958 --> 28:16.291
Go for it, Kang.

28:31.958 --> 28:35.208
<i>Maybe I'm moving a little too fast.</i>

28:36.875 --> 28:41.083
<i>I'd love to meet you and I thought
that we could hang out this week.</i>

28:42.041 --> 28:43.875
<i>Any day, if you'd like.</i>

28:48.166 --> 28:52.750
<i>Of course, I'd love to, but this week I...</i>

28:52.833 --> 28:55.708
<i>I don't know if I can. Because I'm away.</i>

29:10.625 --> 29:13.416
Hey, looks like the new girl
has a crush on Kang.

29:14.083 --> 29:15.750
Right? You like Kang?

29:16.250 --> 29:18.416
Typical. He suits you.

29:18.500 --> 29:20.875
No, I don't like him, no, no, no.

29:20.958 --> 29:24.708
Come on, girl, you can tell us.
We're like your best friends, you know?

29:24.791 --> 29:27.250
- Am I right or not, Ellie?
- If you say so.

29:32.416 --> 29:33.583
I'm Perla, and you are?

29:35.166 --> 29:36.083
Klara.

29:36.958 --> 29:37.875
Nice to meet you.

30:14.416 --> 30:16.833
Easy, guys, easy, please, let's go.

30:17.416 --> 30:18.958
Watch out for the broken glass.

30:21.125 --> 30:23.250
Let's go. Come on, this way.

30:24.375 --> 30:25.666
Let's go, quickly.

30:26.833 --> 30:28.166
Come on, out, hurry.

30:52.000 --> 30:53.791
What's up, Hoodie?

30:53.875 --> 30:56.291
- What's up yourself, Diego?
- Nothing, Perla.

30:57.666 --> 30:59.416
I'm not going to stay here, actually.

30:59.500 --> 31:01.416
I'll take a walk around the school.
Wanna come?

31:02.208 --> 31:04.166
What do you say? Ellie?

31:05.416 --> 31:07.416
- I...
- No, I'd better stay here.

31:08.250 --> 31:09.333
We're staying here.

31:09.833 --> 31:12.583
Okay, then. If you change your minds,
you know what to do.

31:14.583 --> 31:16.458
Shout my name, okay?

31:21.666 --> 31:23.083
What's that guy's deal?

31:24.916 --> 31:28.125
- Are you going to meet Klara or not?
- She told me she was away.

31:28.208 --> 31:29.125
- What about you?
- Me?

31:29.208 --> 31:30.625
- Listen--
- You gave it your all.

31:30.708 --> 31:32.000
I have to show off a little.

31:32.083 --> 31:33.500
No, no, no. Don't say my name.

31:34.500 --> 31:35.750
What are you doing? Stop!

31:36.291 --> 31:39.166
- What's wrong with you?
- Nothing's wrong with me. Nothing.

31:47.416 --> 31:49.291
- Why don't you sit next to Yana?
- Nah.

31:51.333 --> 31:52.333
Why not?

31:52.958 --> 31:53.916
Because.

31:54.458 --> 31:55.666
Well, you're an idiot.

31:55.750 --> 31:58.875
Wouldn't it be nice for the two of you
to be out there in the snow,

31:58.958 --> 32:01.625
sharing your body heat?

32:04.125 --> 32:04.958
Kang?

32:05.041 --> 32:07.666
How was your day?

32:09.166 --> 32:10.000
Dude?

32:15.333 --> 32:16.250
Did you hear that?

32:17.000 --> 32:17.916
Hear what?

32:18.000 --> 32:20.500
I just sent a text
and it rang right over there.

32:20.583 --> 32:23.250
- To who, Yana? No, Yana's over there.
- Not to Yana, to Klara.

32:23.333 --> 32:25.291
Stop it!
Klara doesn't give a darn about you!

32:25.375 --> 32:26.291
Look, look.

32:36.083 --> 32:37.333
It's true.

32:38.708 --> 32:40.416
Call her. Call.

32:52.458 --> 32:53.625
Someone's calling you.

32:54.666 --> 32:55.583
No.

32:56.625 --> 32:58.791
Klara, what's wrong?

32:58.875 --> 32:59.708
Nothing.

33:15.625 --> 33:16.583
Klara?

33:26.416 --> 33:29.375
That chick's really weird, man.
I like her.

34:03.083 --> 34:06.333
I can't believe I found you.

34:11.291 --> 34:12.208
Klara?

34:21.666 --> 34:22.708
Can I help you?

34:25.458 --> 34:26.291
Go away.

34:29.208 --> 34:32.166
I don't mind waiting, okay?

34:33.166 --> 34:36.041
Kang, just leave me alone! Go away.

34:39.333 --> 34:40.250
Please.

34:45.666 --> 34:46.500
Okay.

35:37.833 --> 35:41.333
How was your day?
I'm stuck because of the snow

35:41.416 --> 35:47.708
Where can we see each other alone?

36:14.000 --> 36:16.083
- Hi, Kang.
- Hi, Klara.

36:26.166 --> 36:27.458
A chocolate shake.

36:31.000 --> 36:31.916
Candy.

36:35.208 --> 36:36.041
A roll.

36:36.958 --> 36:38.416
This, the chocolate.

36:53.916 --> 36:55.500
I pictured you differently.

36:55.583 --> 36:56.875
How?

36:56.958 --> 37:00.250
Not with this scared face,
you mean? Because...

37:01.583 --> 37:02.958
No, like this.

37:03.875 --> 37:05.500
Your smile...

37:07.541 --> 37:09.083
It's really pretty.

37:13.416 --> 37:14.791
I pictured you differently too.

37:15.791 --> 37:16.666
Yeah, how?

37:18.333 --> 37:20.791
Well, not so, uh...

37:22.208 --> 37:23.291
healthy.

37:27.333 --> 37:29.125
<i>And this boy you've told me about?</i>

37:30.875 --> 37:32.166
Kang is his name, right?

37:34.041 --> 37:35.041
How's it going?

37:38.416 --> 37:39.375
Well, I don't know.

37:42.541 --> 37:43.416
What?

37:43.500 --> 37:44.833
I don't know. You tell me.

37:45.916 --> 37:48.041
Well, he told me he wanted us
to see each other.

37:49.041 --> 37:51.708
And I want to get to know him,
but... I don't know.

37:53.000 --> 37:55.166
I want to, but I'm scared too.

37:55.708 --> 37:58.791
But then I think about it,
and everything that has scared me,

37:58.875 --> 38:00.416
scared me less after I did it.

38:00.500 --> 38:03.791
<i>Just think, Klara, about all the times
that you've been brave.</i>

38:05.333 --> 38:08.541
<i>- Things have always turned out well.
- Yeah, but it's not just seeing him.</i>

38:08.625 --> 38:09.958
<i>I'd like to be honest with him.</i>

38:10.791 --> 38:13.250
<i>I don't know if, when he finds out
certain things about me,</i>

38:13.333 --> 38:15.416
<i>he'll freak out or distance himself or...</i>

38:17.666 --> 38:18.666
Do you like it?

38:19.750 --> 38:20.666
Yeah.

38:25.750 --> 38:26.666
Look.

38:28.250 --> 38:29.291
I made this one.

38:34.083 --> 38:35.541
- This one?
- No, to the left.

38:36.083 --> 38:37.083
- That one?
- That one.

38:38.166 --> 38:39.541
It's the ugliest, isn't it?

38:45.250 --> 38:46.458
Technically,

38:47.750 --> 38:51.375
I've written you a song.
So I think you can paint my portrait now.

38:53.750 --> 38:54.750
Okay.

38:56.875 --> 39:00.666
Well... How would you pose? Let's see.

39:03.875 --> 39:04.791
Like that?

39:05.541 --> 39:06.541
Yeah.

39:06.625 --> 39:08.791
You'll have to stay like that
for a long time.

39:17.666 --> 39:19.000
- Like that?
- Yeah.

39:19.083 --> 39:20.416
I'm comfortable like this.

39:21.041 --> 39:22.791
Uh, okay, great.

39:25.041 --> 39:26.125
Let's see.

39:46.416 --> 39:47.458
No...

39:50.208 --> 39:53.666
I haven't painted in a long time, Kang.
I can't. I'm sorry.

39:56.375 --> 39:57.833
No worries, it's no big deal.

40:02.125 --> 40:04.375
And I didn't tell you
the truth before either.

40:05.750 --> 40:07.500
I haven't this whole time.

40:12.041 --> 40:14.791
I couldn't go to class
because... I was at home.

40:16.166 --> 40:18.625
Because these last few months
have been really hard for me.

40:18.708 --> 40:19.958
I was...

40:21.000 --> 40:25.000
sick, but now I'm better, yeah.

40:26.708 --> 40:27.625
I'm glad.

40:35.833 --> 40:36.833
Come with me, hurry.

41:02.625 --> 41:05.750
<i>I don't know. I think I want to try,
and if it goes well, great.</i>

41:05.833 --> 41:09.875
<i>And if not, well, then I know,
and I stop worrying about it, you know?</i>

41:09.958 --> 41:12.083
Klara, don't worry.

41:13.333 --> 41:15.166
There's no hurry. Don't rush.

41:18.791 --> 41:20.416
But that's how you know.

41:23.708 --> 41:27.625
By being around people
and seeing if you feel good with them

41:27.708 --> 41:29.541
and they feel good with you.

41:30.458 --> 41:32.041
I suppose.

41:32.125 --> 41:33.791
These are addictive, aren't they?

41:35.166 --> 41:36.375
Yeah, a little.

41:38.458 --> 41:42.958
3. DARE TO FEEL

41:43.041 --> 41:44.125
Hoodie!

41:45.041 --> 41:45.875
What did he say?

41:45.958 --> 41:47.583
Nothing, that's for me.

41:49.166 --> 41:50.291
What are you doing, Diego?

41:50.375 --> 41:52.666
Putting a little excitement
in my life, Kang.

41:52.750 --> 41:54.958
You should try it. Look.

42:02.875 --> 42:04.625
- He killed himself.
- Are you okay?

42:11.583 --> 42:12.416
Impressive.

42:15.250 --> 42:16.375
That he's still alive.

42:19.250 --> 42:20.291
What?

42:21.166 --> 42:24.583
What are you all doing here?
That's it, detention for everyone.

42:33.750 --> 42:35.250
Kang, your parents are here.

42:35.333 --> 42:38.208
I'll go with you so I can see
how they give you an earful.

42:42.875 --> 42:45.125
Erick, that's Klara.

42:46.958 --> 42:48.666
Hi. Nice to meet you.

42:49.916 --> 42:50.833
Likewise.

42:52.500 --> 42:53.500
Come on, let's go.

42:54.166 --> 42:55.416
See you around, Klara.

42:55.500 --> 42:56.708
See you around, Kang.

42:58.625 --> 42:59.708
Don't worry about me.

43:01.125 --> 43:01.958
Bye, Diego.

43:08.541 --> 43:10.875
So, just you and me left.

43:12.375 --> 43:13.333
Yeah.

43:14.750 --> 43:17.166
Destiny wants us
to be friends, right, Hoodie?

43:19.458 --> 43:20.958
Why do you call me Hoodie?

43:21.041 --> 43:22.125
I like to be original.

43:22.208 --> 43:23.750
Wow. So original.

43:26.666 --> 43:27.666
Yup.

43:30.583 --> 43:32.500
- You know what?
- What?

43:32.583 --> 43:35.000
Well... I've known your name
for a while now.

43:37.958 --> 43:38.875
How?

43:39.750 --> 43:41.541
I saw you once in the hospital.

43:44.250 --> 43:48.708
In the chemotherapy wing,
when I went to pick up my father.

43:50.791 --> 43:54.125
Yeah, I'm Darío's son.

43:55.291 --> 43:57.666
Who, by the way,
never stopped talking about you.

43:57.750 --> 43:59.625
You always made him laugh.

43:59.708 --> 44:01.708
And he loved it
when you ate all his Jell-O.

44:07.291 --> 44:08.375
I had no idea, Diego.

44:09.208 --> 44:10.166
Yeah, I know.

44:13.666 --> 44:15.875
But we're going to have
to be friends either way.

44:18.208 --> 44:19.208
It will be an honor.

44:24.666 --> 44:25.750
Wait.

44:26.541 --> 44:27.958
- Are you Little Kangaroo?
- No.

44:28.041 --> 44:29.708
- No, no, no.
- I just remembered

44:29.791 --> 44:31.541
- that your father called you that.
- Not me.

44:31.625 --> 44:33.833
- I'm going to call you that from now on.
- No.

44:33.916 --> 44:36.083
- Hoodie!
- Little Kangaroo.

44:41.916 --> 44:43.333
But, K, you got detention.

44:43.416 --> 44:44.791
- I don't understand.
- I know, K2.

44:44.875 --> 44:46.708
- Tell me what happened so I--
- It was cool.

44:46.791 --> 44:50.875
Trust me, I never thought I'd say this,
but I miss school a little bit.

44:50.958 --> 44:53.333
- No, no, no, please, no.
- I'm telling the truth.

44:53.416 --> 44:56.708
- You used to wear certain clothes... No.
- It's true, it's true!

44:56.791 --> 44:59.416
- The pictures we saw...
- I had my own particular style...

44:59.500 --> 45:01.125
- No, no, no.
- You looked horrible, Andy.

45:01.208 --> 45:03.041
Don't change the subject.

45:03.125 --> 45:06.833
What am I going to do with you, K?
Look at me. What should I do with you?

45:06.916 --> 45:09.833
- Should I punish you or what?
- I don't know. Whatever you want...

45:09.916 --> 45:11.500
What? No.

45:12.000 --> 45:13.041
Look,

45:13.125 --> 45:16.375
- you could ground me at home for a week.
- Yeah.

45:16.458 --> 45:19.500
A week more or a week less,
it's all the same.

45:19.583 --> 45:22.500
She's actually right. Isn't she?

45:22.583 --> 45:25.916
I don't know. I just don't know
what to do with you both, honestly.

45:27.500 --> 45:32.041
<i>I missed you. Always stay by my side.
Don't leave me.</i>

45:32.125 --> 45:36.208
<i>Hold me. I love you. Tae-ho.</i>

45:40.708 --> 45:42.625
FACETIME VIDEO
KANG

45:48.291 --> 45:49.291
<i>Hi, Klara.</i>

45:50.250 --> 45:51.125
Hi.

45:51.708 --> 45:52.625
<i>How's it going?</i>

45:53.625 --> 45:56.958
Good. I was just here watching a... Well...

45:58.125 --> 45:59.291
<i>Hey.</i>

45:59.375 --> 46:00.208
What?

46:00.291 --> 46:03.541
<i>Want to meet tomorrow at 11:00?</i>

46:04.333 --> 46:07.166
Well... I don't know if I feel like it.

46:10.500 --> 46:12.000
Kidding, I'm kidding.

46:13.583 --> 46:15.291
Sure, sounds good.

46:16.625 --> 46:18.291
Will you bring me some chocolate?

46:18.375 --> 46:19.291
<i>See you tomorrow.</i>

46:19.833 --> 46:21.083
Okay.

46:21.166 --> 46:22.083
<i>Bye.</i>

46:30.083 --> 46:31.333
<i>Where are you?</i>

46:33.625 --> 46:34.750
I can't see you, Kang.

46:35.833 --> 46:36.916
Follow my voice.

46:39.291 --> 46:40.458
Am I getting there?

46:41.291 --> 46:43.166
I think so.

46:45.166 --> 46:46.083
I found you.

46:48.541 --> 46:49.541
My chocolate.

46:51.125 --> 46:51.958
I forgot it.

46:53.875 --> 46:55.750
Well then, I'm leaving. Goodbye.

46:55.833 --> 46:56.916
No, wait.

47:24.958 --> 47:26.000
I love it.

47:27.708 --> 47:29.666
It was weird
not hearing your show yesterday.

47:30.291 --> 47:31.916
It was impossible because of the snow.

47:33.041 --> 47:35.750
Hey, why don't you ever sing on your show?

47:37.291 --> 47:39.666
Because I'm too embarrassed.

47:41.708 --> 47:44.541
Well, if you enter the competition...

47:46.750 --> 47:48.958
you'll have to sing
in front of a lot of people.

47:49.791 --> 47:51.250
Don't remind me.

47:54.875 --> 47:58.083
If they choose me, will you come with me?

48:00.000 --> 48:02.791
The only thing is,
we'd have to go to Madrid.

48:05.750 --> 48:08.458
Yeah, if you want...

48:25.541 --> 48:27.500
- I can't believe it.
- I messed it up.

48:29.291 --> 48:30.916
I'm going that way.

48:31.000 --> 48:32.333
- Okay...
- Bye.

48:34.791 --> 48:36.208
- Okay, see you later.
- I'm going.

48:43.833 --> 48:44.750
Klara?

48:45.541 --> 48:46.375
Hi.

48:46.458 --> 48:47.750
Can we talk for a minute?

48:48.625 --> 48:50.250
Can we do it later? I'm running late.

48:50.333 --> 48:51.250
Just one minute.

48:53.250 --> 48:54.125
Okay.

49:07.375 --> 49:08.333
Look,

49:08.416 --> 49:11.750
I wanted to ask you something
because... I have some concerns.

49:11.833 --> 49:12.750
Okay, what?

49:20.958 --> 49:22.833
- Is this you?
<i>- Leave me alone, please.</i>

49:27.416 --> 49:28.833
How did you get that?

49:30.333 --> 49:31.833
Where did you find it?

49:31.916 --> 49:34.458
I know Kang really well, and...

49:35.166 --> 49:40.208
And I stood by him during
really, really tough times in his life.

49:41.416 --> 49:43.791
And I know what's good for him
and what isn't.

49:46.041 --> 49:48.041
And someone like you isn't...

49:49.291 --> 49:50.958
I don't think you're good for him.

49:51.750 --> 49:53.625
Wait... I don't understand.

49:54.833 --> 49:56.500
I'm worried about him, you know?

49:58.250 --> 49:59.083
What?

49:59.666 --> 50:02.208
I don't want him to be
with a girl who has so many issues.

50:04.541 --> 50:06.708
Are you guys together? I didn't know.

50:06.791 --> 50:08.833
It doesn't matter
if we're together or not.

50:10.416 --> 50:12.375
He's never going to notice you.

50:16.916 --> 50:20.916
I have friends at your old school
who told me lots of things.

50:22.791 --> 50:25.083
And I don't want to have to send
this video to everyone

50:25.166 --> 50:27.083
to show them who you really are, but...

50:28.958 --> 50:30.250
Have you seen yourself?

51:23.458 --> 51:26.000
Luckily, we did those tests
after your mother's illness.

51:26.083 --> 51:28.458
There's always a genetic risk.

51:28.541 --> 51:30.083
And, in your case, Klara,

51:30.166 --> 51:33.333
the analyses confirm
the presence of cancerous cells.

51:35.916 --> 51:38.416
We have to act as soon as possible.

52:19.958 --> 52:22.083
I'm waiting for you in the car
'Cause it's freezing

52:22.166 --> 52:23.541
It's orange
A little old

52:23.625 --> 52:26.333
I'm sorry

52:38.166 --> 52:40.166
I'm sorry, I had to leave
Another time

52:40.250 --> 52:42.000
Is everything okay?

52:50.166 --> 52:51.125
Klara!

52:51.958 --> 52:55.000
Klara! Hey, Klara!

52:56.666 --> 52:58.500
- Hi.
- I was calling you.

53:00.041 --> 53:00.958
Sorry.

53:03.333 --> 53:04.666
- Wow!
- What?

53:04.750 --> 53:06.250
What a face!

53:06.333 --> 53:07.666
- Thanks.
- No.

53:07.750 --> 53:10.541
- Just what I needed to hear right now.
- No, no, but...

53:11.125 --> 53:12.458
- I didn't mean that.
- Sure.

53:13.250 --> 53:14.750
Don't ask, Diego.

53:15.583 --> 53:16.500
Okay.

53:23.708 --> 53:24.916
Do you want to be alone?

53:29.458 --> 53:30.375
No.

53:32.750 --> 53:34.208
You want to talk about it, right?

53:35.916 --> 53:37.000
Absolutely, yeah.

53:39.916 --> 53:40.916
Well...

53:43.416 --> 53:44.333
I've got an idea.

53:45.708 --> 53:46.541
What?

53:47.250 --> 53:48.833
- Come on.
- I'm coming.

54:17.916 --> 54:21.041
I can't think of a better person
to enjoy this delicacy with.

54:23.083 --> 54:25.541
That's the first nice thing
you've said to me.

54:25.625 --> 54:26.541
Thanks, Hoodie.

54:27.916 --> 54:30.333
I wasn't talking about you.
I was talking about your dad.

54:35.500 --> 54:37.625
Anyway, you're...

54:38.875 --> 54:41.000
ten percent of the reason I'm here.

54:41.083 --> 54:44.083
What? Only ten? No, much more.

54:44.166 --> 54:45.208
- Hey.
- What?

54:45.291 --> 54:46.250
- What do you mean?
- No...

54:46.333 --> 54:48.708
If you keep complaining,
it'll drop to nine pretty soon.

55:04.875 --> 55:07.291
This place is horrible,
and everything that's happened.

55:09.791 --> 55:12.958
But... I like being here with you.

55:14.041 --> 55:15.041
Me too.

55:32.000 --> 55:33.000
Where are you going?

55:34.916 --> 55:36.250
Now you're coming with me.

55:36.791 --> 55:37.708
Okay.

56:00.583 --> 56:02.583
Dad, am I making too much noise?

56:03.458 --> 56:05.375
No, not at all. I like your song.

56:05.916 --> 56:07.750
I think you're going to win.

56:09.916 --> 56:11.333
Kang, I'm here.

56:12.416 --> 56:15.666
If there's anything
you want to talk about, I'm here for you.

56:18.750 --> 56:19.666
Thanks.

56:26.791 --> 56:28.250
Now I understand the K thing.

56:38.791 --> 56:41.041
It feels like a lot of time
has passed, Mommy.

56:46.916 --> 56:50.166
This is my friend. His name's Diego.

56:52.250 --> 56:53.791
So now we're friends, huh?

57:03.291 --> 57:05.041
I wasn't able to come here before.

57:10.875 --> 57:12.208
Forgive me...

57:13.625 --> 57:16.083
for having left you alone
for such a long time.

57:36.583 --> 57:40.041
<i>The other day, I wasn't very clear
when I talked about love.</i>

57:42.416 --> 57:45.166
I didn't say what I was thinking
or what I was actually feeling.

57:45.958 --> 57:48.958
I think that love always makes you suffer.

57:50.625 --> 57:52.875
<i>I'm afraid to fall in love</i>

57:52.958 --> 57:55.958
<i>in case it doesn't work out
and I end up losing that person.</i>

57:57.916 --> 57:59.625
<i>That's what this song is about.</i>

58:02.875 --> 58:07.166
<i>That's why sometimes it's better
not to fight for a love</i>

58:07.250 --> 58:10.875
<i>that's never going to happen
and just accept it as a friendship.</i>

59:15.875 --> 59:16.791
Thank you.

59:18.625 --> 59:20.750
- Look.
- What?

59:41.625 --> 59:44.583
<i>Kang, don't cover yourself.
You're really handsome. Come on.</i>

59:53.333 --> 59:54.166
Kang!

01:00:10.583 --> 01:00:11.416
Here.

01:00:12.500 --> 01:00:13.583
Kang!

01:00:13.666 --> 01:00:14.750
Wake up, man!

01:00:19.583 --> 01:00:21.833
We're going to the party
after this, right?

01:00:23.458 --> 01:00:24.541
- No.
- What?

01:00:24.625 --> 01:00:27.375
- Come on...
- No, no, no, I only came for that.

01:00:29.916 --> 01:00:32.416
Fine, if you're all going,
I'll think about it.

01:00:33.250 --> 01:00:35.458
I go to all of them. I never miss one.

01:00:35.541 --> 01:00:37.041
- Sure, all of them...
- I go to all...

01:00:37.125 --> 01:00:38.541
the ones I'm invited to.

01:00:38.625 --> 01:00:40.125
Yeah, and the ones you aren't.

01:00:40.916 --> 01:00:41.833
Also.

01:00:43.500 --> 01:00:44.416
Also.

01:00:48.583 --> 01:00:49.791
Kang, shoot!

01:00:50.458 --> 01:00:52.375
- Come on!
- Damn!

01:00:53.833 --> 01:00:55.416
Wow, great goal.

01:01:02.000 --> 01:01:03.000
Kang!

01:01:03.791 --> 01:01:05.541
- Come on!
- Bravo!

01:01:33.083 --> 01:01:34.041
What are you doing?

01:01:34.708 --> 01:01:36.125
Are you taking us to the party?

01:01:36.833 --> 01:01:37.666
Not you, no.

01:01:37.750 --> 01:01:41.208
Well, me, Perla, Ellie,

01:01:41.291 --> 01:01:42.875
and Klara.

01:01:43.708 --> 01:01:44.875
I'm not going.

01:01:44.958 --> 01:01:46.833
Look, let's do this.

01:01:46.916 --> 01:01:47.958
You take us to the party

01:01:48.041 --> 01:01:50.750
and I won't tell Klara you spent
the whole game looking at her.

01:01:50.833 --> 01:01:52.875
With that little look on your face,
like this.

01:02:00.708 --> 01:02:01.625
- Fine.
- Yeah?

01:02:01.708 --> 01:02:02.666
- Yeah.
- Yeah?

01:02:02.750 --> 01:02:03.708
I said yeah.

01:02:04.416 --> 01:02:05.416
Okay.

01:02:05.958 --> 01:02:07.625
Girls, get in. Kang's taking us.

01:02:09.625 --> 01:02:11.250
By the way, it was a great game.

01:02:16.208 --> 01:02:19.916
- No, you in the front. You get car sick.
- Wow. Party! Hello.

01:02:20.000 --> 01:02:21.375
What are you talking about?

01:02:22.333 --> 01:02:23.750
Party.

01:02:27.416 --> 01:02:29.000
- Hi, Kang.
- Start it?

01:02:29.083 --> 01:02:31.041
- Hi, K.
- Great game, wasn't it?

01:02:31.125 --> 01:02:32.166
Yeah, yeah.

01:02:32.791 --> 01:02:34.833
What a piece of junk, man.

01:02:34.916 --> 01:02:37.708
Hey, leave him alone.
At least he's taking us.

01:02:37.791 --> 01:02:39.625
And I'm in no condition to walk.

01:02:50.833 --> 01:02:52.541
What's up, hot stuff? How are you?

01:02:54.083 --> 01:02:55.541
- Everything okay? Yeah?
- Good.

01:02:56.333 --> 01:02:58.125
Hi. Hello.

01:03:00.708 --> 01:03:01.541
Hi.

01:03:03.958 --> 01:03:04.958
You actually came.

01:03:07.291 --> 01:03:08.458
They talked me into it.

01:03:09.333 --> 01:03:10.875
- Awesome.
- Come on, come in.

01:03:14.250 --> 01:03:16.333
Those are the ones who talked you into it.

01:03:20.125 --> 01:03:21.208
Yeah.

01:03:21.291 --> 01:03:23.916
Well, let's go
and then we'll get something to drink.

01:03:34.250 --> 01:03:36.166
You played so well in the game.

01:03:36.250 --> 01:03:38.166
- Thanks.
- You scored an excellent goal.

01:03:43.125 --> 01:03:43.958
What's up?

01:03:45.916 --> 01:03:46.916
Who is it?

01:03:49.000 --> 01:03:50.291
Nothing. I'll be right back.

01:03:56.875 --> 01:03:59.375
Klara, they've chosen me.

01:04:01.916 --> 01:04:03.250
- Your song?
- Yeah.

01:04:07.666 --> 01:04:10.125
Congratulations, Kang.
I'm really happy for you.

01:04:10.958 --> 01:04:12.666
- Can we talk somewhere else?
- Yeah.

01:04:29.291 --> 01:04:31.708
I've been a little weird
the last few days.

01:04:31.791 --> 01:04:32.958
Well, and you too.

01:04:34.500 --> 01:04:35.416
I know.

01:04:38.291 --> 01:04:40.791
But I'm always
a little weird anyway, you know?

01:04:42.333 --> 01:04:44.125
- That's true.
- Hey!

01:04:47.416 --> 01:04:50.333
No, seriously. I'm sorry.

01:04:51.958 --> 01:04:54.833
I don't want to ruin our friendship.

01:04:56.041 --> 01:04:58.125
I don't want to ruin it either.

01:05:00.958 --> 01:05:02.791
Why did you send me that painting?

01:05:04.583 --> 01:05:06.166
Because of what you asked for.

01:05:07.708 --> 01:05:09.791
It was a place I went to with my mom.

01:05:11.250 --> 01:05:12.416
I'm in that painting.

01:05:15.000 --> 01:05:15.958
What?

01:05:17.083 --> 01:05:19.125
The igloo at the bottom left.

01:05:19.916 --> 01:05:21.500
- Yeah.
- I made that.

01:05:22.208 --> 01:05:24.083
Well, my brother Jung and I.

01:05:25.083 --> 01:05:26.083
What?

01:05:27.833 --> 01:05:30.416
Wait, what? You've got a brother?

01:05:30.500 --> 01:05:31.875
- Yeah.
- Older than you?

01:05:35.500 --> 01:05:36.500
<i>How old is he?</i>

01:05:37.875 --> 01:05:39.875
He should have been 21 now,

01:05:40.791 --> 01:05:42.958
but he didn't even make it to 19.

01:05:47.041 --> 01:05:50.875
<i>That day, the igloo collapsed on top of me</i>

01:05:50.958 --> 01:05:53.083
<i>and Jung came to my rescue.</i>

01:05:55.416 --> 01:05:56.458
<i>He always did.</i>

01:06:06.666 --> 01:06:08.916
<i>One year later, he had an accident</i>

01:06:09.000 --> 01:06:10.666
<i>and couldn't play soccer anymore.</i>

01:06:12.166 --> 01:06:13.458
<i>That was his dream.</i>

01:06:25.041 --> 01:06:28.625
I should have rescued him
like he rescued me.

01:06:41.750 --> 01:06:42.916
Jung?

01:06:44.125 --> 01:06:45.208
Jung?

01:06:47.250 --> 01:06:48.083
Jung?

01:06:49.625 --> 01:06:52.291
<i>- Jung... committed suicide.</i>
- Jung!

01:07:03.125 --> 01:07:06.500
<i>When it was all over,
I blamed the whole world,</i>

01:07:06.583 --> 01:07:08.333
<i>but I blamed myself most of all.</i>

01:07:08.416 --> 01:07:12.541
It's your fault my brother is dead!
You should have seen him.

01:07:12.625 --> 01:07:14.291
<i>I was so sad, so lost,</i>

01:07:14.375 --> 01:07:18.000
<i>that I needed the help
of a psychiatrist to go on living.</i>

01:07:27.666 --> 01:07:31.250
<i>Thanks to her,
I learned how to control my panic attacks.</i>

01:07:34.416 --> 01:07:36.750
<i>I got back everything I had lost.</i>

01:07:37.291 --> 01:07:39.250
<i>I managed to go back to school,</i>

01:07:39.958 --> 01:07:41.875
<i>and now I'm not looking
at the past every day.</i>

01:08:06.458 --> 01:08:07.416
Klara.

01:08:08.208 --> 01:08:09.833
I've been looking for you.

01:08:09.916 --> 01:08:11.125
Come on, let's talk.

01:08:17.291 --> 01:08:18.291
I told you already.

01:08:19.041 --> 01:08:20.375
To stay away from Kang.

01:08:22.000 --> 01:08:24.458
Now I'm going to have
to tell everyone that you're crazy.

01:08:24.958 --> 01:08:27.625
And we'll see
who wants to come near you after that.

01:08:28.166 --> 01:08:29.416
There's nothing wrong with me.

01:08:29.500 --> 01:08:30.625
- You think so?
- There isn't.

01:08:31.541 --> 01:08:32.875
Don't you take pills?

01:08:34.541 --> 01:08:37.458
Didn't you spend months
without leaving your house?

01:08:40.666 --> 01:08:41.500
Yeah.

01:08:42.083 --> 01:08:45.208
Okay. So that's
what I'm going to tell everyone.

01:08:47.416 --> 01:08:48.375
I don't care.

01:08:49.875 --> 01:08:51.708
- I have nothing to hide.
- No?

01:09:04.958 --> 01:09:06.708
Everyone, check what I've sent you.

01:09:06.791 --> 01:09:09.166
- This girl, the new girl...
- What is this?

01:09:09.916 --> 01:09:12.583
...she left her old school
because she's not right in the head.

01:09:14.333 --> 01:09:15.333
Turn it off.

01:09:20.791 --> 01:09:23.833
Now everyone is going to see you cry,
because that's what you deserve.

01:09:25.875 --> 01:09:26.958
Leave her alone.

01:09:27.041 --> 01:09:28.416
Why are you getting involved now?

01:09:28.958 --> 01:09:30.833
So you don't do to her
what you do to people.

01:09:31.166 --> 01:09:32.458
What you do to me.

01:09:32.541 --> 01:09:34.541
Look at this girl.
What are you talking about?

01:09:42.375 --> 01:09:43.333
I'm going to tell.

01:09:45.583 --> 01:09:46.416
What?

01:09:46.500 --> 01:09:47.791
What you did to me.

01:09:48.416 --> 01:09:50.375
What you did the other day.
I'm going to tell.

01:09:50.916 --> 01:09:53.333
And... who's going to believe you?

01:09:54.166 --> 01:09:55.708
- I'm telling too.
- And me.

01:09:55.791 --> 01:09:56.791
Me too.

01:09:59.125 --> 01:10:01.500
- Hold on--
- I'm also going to tell what you did.

01:10:03.625 --> 01:10:04.750
Are you kidding me?

01:10:06.708 --> 01:10:09.541
- After everything I've done for you?
- Get out of my house, Yana.

01:10:14.583 --> 01:10:15.583
Get out.

01:10:38.000 --> 01:10:39.958
- Thanks, guys.
- Thank you.

01:11:44.541 --> 01:11:47.125
My first kiss. Kang.

01:12:09.416 --> 01:12:12.291
So, tell me,
how have you been feeling these days?

01:12:15.666 --> 01:12:16.833
Well...

01:12:18.458 --> 01:12:21.125
I don't think
I've felt this way for a long time.

01:12:22.750 --> 01:12:24.291
I'm...

01:12:28.125 --> 01:12:29.750
happy...

01:12:31.291 --> 01:12:34.583
and... I want to feel this happiness...

01:12:35.708 --> 01:12:37.458
because I know it won't last forever.

01:12:37.541 --> 01:12:40.500
Yeah, you're right.
Forever is a long time.

01:12:42.750 --> 01:12:44.000
I'm like this landscape,

01:12:45.875 --> 01:12:48.708
which was beautiful
with the snow covering everything.

01:12:48.791 --> 01:12:50.750
But... not anymore.

01:12:51.958 --> 01:12:55.833
Now the snow is grey
and... soon it will all melt away.

01:12:56.708 --> 01:12:59.000
What do you think
your landscape will be like

01:12:59.083 --> 01:13:01.291
when the snow disappears
and good weather arrives?

01:13:05.875 --> 01:13:07.500
- Come on.
- I don't know.

01:13:31.333 --> 01:13:32.791
<i>Hopefully...</i>

01:13:33.875 --> 01:13:36.250
<i>like one of those I used to see
when I could travel.</i>

01:13:39.375 --> 01:13:42.125
- Full of color and new things.
- Sorry, "hopefully"?

01:13:42.666 --> 01:13:44.875
What do you mean, "hopefully"? Girl...

01:13:46.458 --> 01:13:47.875
it's going to happen, right?

01:13:50.291 --> 01:13:53.041
Whatever it's like,
I'll have to learn to love it.

01:14:09.333 --> 01:14:15.333
4. LEARN TO LOVE YOURSELF

01:14:22.125 --> 01:14:23.708
- Hi.
- Hi.

01:14:24.208 --> 01:14:25.500
Hey, you look so pretty!

01:14:26.750 --> 01:14:27.875
I like your curls.

01:14:29.083 --> 01:14:30.000
Thanks.

01:14:30.666 --> 01:14:31.666
Where are you going?

01:14:35.583 --> 01:14:37.166
- What?
- I'm going to the movies.

01:14:38.750 --> 01:14:39.750
With whom?

01:14:40.458 --> 01:14:41.458
With a friend.

01:14:51.791 --> 01:14:55.500
- Aren't you going to ask me anything?
- Um, no.

01:14:56.125 --> 01:14:57.125
- No, no.
- Wow.

01:14:58.500 --> 01:15:00.125
- Are you okay?
- Yeah. Okay, then.

01:15:01.708 --> 01:15:03.041
Have a good time, K.

01:15:03.625 --> 01:15:04.916
- Thanks.
- Okay?

01:15:06.625 --> 01:15:08.333
- Bye.
- Bye.

01:15:21.041 --> 01:15:22.750
It's this one. Go ahead.

01:15:23.541 --> 01:15:24.458
Sorry.

01:16:21.916 --> 01:16:28.625
DON'T WORRY...

01:16:28.708 --> 01:16:32.791
THINK ABOUT SOMETHING NICE

01:16:48.125 --> 01:16:50.083
Mom, yours is much better.

01:16:50.166 --> 01:16:54.375
Well, yours will be even better
when you're my age.

01:16:57.916 --> 01:16:59.333
How about going for a swim?

01:16:59.416 --> 01:17:02.708
- What are you saying?
- No. It's freezing cold. No, no.

01:17:02.791 --> 01:17:06.208
How can we come to the beach
and not have a swim? It'd be a shame.

01:17:07.583 --> 01:17:08.500
Are you sure?

01:17:12.666 --> 01:17:14.625
- Come on.
- Mom, the water will be freezing.

01:17:14.708 --> 01:17:18.375
- Aren't you cold?
- Don't think about it!

01:17:20.083 --> 01:17:21.291
Come on!

01:17:22.791 --> 01:17:24.166
Our clothes! Our clothes!

01:17:26.666 --> 01:17:28.500
Come on! Let's go!

01:17:32.875 --> 01:17:34.583
It's so cold!

01:17:34.666 --> 01:17:37.750
Who did that? Mom! Klara!

01:17:41.666 --> 01:17:42.750
No, it's so cold!

01:17:56.083 --> 01:17:58.208
<i>So cool, and we almost missed it!</i>

01:18:05.125 --> 01:18:06.125
Hey.

01:18:09.250 --> 01:18:10.208
What?

01:18:13.416 --> 01:18:14.541
You're really pretty.

01:18:22.416 --> 01:18:23.333
Hey.

01:18:24.625 --> 01:18:25.583
What?

01:18:27.375 --> 01:18:28.375
So are you.

01:18:35.250 --> 01:18:36.375
Welcome.

01:18:38.416 --> 01:18:39.333
Come in.

01:18:45.000 --> 01:18:46.250
This is surreal.

01:18:52.041 --> 01:18:53.041
What's wrong?

01:18:54.458 --> 01:18:55.958
Well...

01:18:58.458 --> 01:19:02.291
I just need you to wear
your mask, "Batkang."

01:19:04.041 --> 01:19:04.875
Yeah.

01:19:11.958 --> 01:19:13.250
Are you going to play a song?

01:19:13.750 --> 01:19:14.666
Yeah.

01:19:24.458 --> 01:19:25.833
I'm going to tell you something.

01:19:26.916 --> 01:19:28.166
Sure.

01:19:28.250 --> 01:19:29.208
Um...

01:19:35.625 --> 01:19:37.625
Before we met...

01:19:39.083 --> 01:19:40.291
I dreamed about you.

01:19:43.291 --> 01:19:44.500
Okay. Look.

01:19:46.833 --> 01:19:49.083
I closed my eyes,

01:19:49.166 --> 01:19:52.041
and you came up close behind me

01:19:52.916 --> 01:19:54.625
and hugged me.

01:19:56.333 --> 01:19:57.750
- And then...
- Like this?

01:19:59.833 --> 01:20:02.875
It was more like... this.

01:20:03.416 --> 01:20:04.416
Yeah.

01:20:05.541 --> 01:20:08.333
And then I turned around...

01:20:11.666 --> 01:20:13.791
and got closer to you.

01:20:15.958 --> 01:20:17.708
And what else happened?

01:20:21.708 --> 01:20:22.791
Close your eyes.

01:20:25.208 --> 01:20:27.208
Close them, but close them for real, okay?

01:20:27.875 --> 01:20:28.958
- Yeah?
- Yeah.

01:20:29.583 --> 01:20:30.791
Really.

01:20:34.291 --> 01:20:35.291
Okay.

01:21:19.458 --> 01:21:22.791
Okay. Now you can open them.

01:23:18.208 --> 01:23:19.250
I'm going.

01:23:22.500 --> 01:23:23.333
Ow.

01:23:29.666 --> 01:23:30.791
Klara,

01:23:30.875 --> 01:23:34.500
do you want us
to get the tickets to Madrid?

01:23:37.916 --> 01:23:40.125
Sure. Yeah, cool.

01:23:48.583 --> 01:23:49.625
Bye, Kang.

01:24:09.458 --> 01:24:12.875
No, everything's okay.
Sorry for waking you.

01:24:12.958 --> 01:24:14.583
I just couldn't sleep.

01:24:15.708 --> 01:24:18.333
So, I just wanted to tell you that...

01:24:19.083 --> 01:24:21.416
Kang, I can't go with you to Madrid.

01:24:23.416 --> 01:24:25.166
I just don't know if I'm ready for that.

01:24:26.125 --> 01:24:30.791
What if I ruin your trip and...
It's a special time for you.

01:24:30.875 --> 01:24:31.875
Klara.

01:24:37.791 --> 01:24:39.125
<i>You know what it is?</i>

01:24:39.666 --> 01:24:41.666
<i>You've fought really hard to get better.</i>

01:24:42.333 --> 01:24:45.666
<i>But... I'm not quite there yet.</i>

01:24:46.416 --> 01:24:48.291
<i>I need a little more time, Kang.</i>

01:24:52.708 --> 01:24:54.666
<i>I have to be okay with myself first.</i>

01:24:57.166 --> 01:24:59.333
<i>But... I want you to know</i>

01:24:59.416 --> 01:25:02.333
<i>that this doesn't change
the way I feel about you at all.</i>

01:25:08.125 --> 01:25:10.208
<i>And I know that love can't conquer all.</i>

01:25:10.291 --> 01:25:12.916
<i>It doesn't cure depression or anxiety or...</i>

01:25:15.666 --> 01:25:18.791
<i>But it does give me strength
and keeps me going.</i>

01:25:22.416 --> 01:25:24.083
<i>That's a lot, Kang.</i>

01:25:26.291 --> 01:25:27.750
I hope you understand.

01:25:42.666 --> 01:25:43.875
When is Perla leaving?

01:25:44.666 --> 01:25:45.791
Perla leaves tomorrow.

01:25:45.875 --> 01:25:47.083
- Tomorrow.
- Yeah.

01:25:48.208 --> 01:25:49.541
Are you going to miss her?

01:25:50.208 --> 01:25:51.541
- Yeah.
- Meh.

01:25:52.833 --> 01:25:54.166
- Yeah.
- A little.

01:25:54.250 --> 01:25:58.208
A little, but we'll see each other soon,
after Christmas.

01:25:58.291 --> 01:25:59.375
Yeah.

01:26:00.833 --> 01:26:02.083
And do you miss Kang?

01:26:05.416 --> 01:26:07.583
By Kang, are you referring
to your secret patient?

01:26:07.666 --> 01:26:09.041
- K.
- What?

01:26:09.583 --> 01:26:11.125
Well, I couldn't tell you.

01:26:14.375 --> 01:26:15.916
No, but, I don't know, you used to...

01:26:16.416 --> 01:26:18.791
love listening to his show,
and now you never do.

01:26:19.541 --> 01:26:20.458
Yeah.

01:26:21.166 --> 01:26:22.166
So?

01:26:23.625 --> 01:26:25.916
- "So"? That's it. Shut up.
- That's it. I'm shutting up.

01:26:26.000 --> 01:26:28.000
- I won't ask more questions. I promise.
- Okay.

01:26:38.625 --> 01:26:39.708
<i>Hi, everyone.</i>

01:26:39.791 --> 01:26:41.708
<i>This is</i> Follow My Voice,

01:26:41.791 --> 01:26:45.416
<i>and I'm Kang, your companion
and friend during the next hour.</i>

01:26:46.916 --> 01:26:52.958
<i>I've never told you that I started
this show at a hard time in my life.</i>

01:26:55.375 --> 01:26:57.250
<i>It was part of my therapy.</i>

01:26:57.833 --> 01:27:01.500
<i>Talking to you all
made me feel less lonely.</i>

01:27:02.875 --> 01:27:04.333
<i>But I kept on hiding.</i>

01:27:05.791 --> 01:27:09.333
<i>All that changed
the day you came into my life, Klara.</i>

01:27:15.583 --> 01:27:17.750
<i>I want you to know that I understand you</i>

01:27:17.833 --> 01:27:21.625
<i>and I'll be thinking of you tomorrow
when I'm on stage.</i>

01:27:40.750 --> 01:27:44.416
I WILL HAVE A HAPPY ENDING

01:28:02.000 --> 01:28:04.125
- This is so cool!
- Girl!

01:28:05.583 --> 01:28:08.458
- No! They're already holding hands.
- What?

01:28:08.541 --> 01:28:10.625
No! That's so cute!

01:28:11.375 --> 01:28:13.375
Am I going to be surrounded
by couples now?

01:28:13.458 --> 01:28:15.916
Well, if Klara's plan
doesn't work out, then no.

01:28:16.000 --> 01:28:18.125
- Ha, look how funny that is.
- Just kidding.

01:28:19.208 --> 01:28:20.208
Let's go, right?

01:28:24.375 --> 01:28:25.916
Uh... Guys, I don't know...

01:28:26.000 --> 01:28:27.791
- Come on, come on!
- No, go on!

01:28:30.416 --> 01:28:31.291
Hi.

01:28:41.333 --> 01:28:42.500
Can you chill out a little?

01:28:42.583 --> 01:28:43.791
We're not going to make it.

01:28:43.875 --> 01:28:47.500
We are, Hoodie.
As soon as it stops, we'll run, okay?

01:28:48.083 --> 01:28:51.500
We'll make it. Relax. Ellie, a joke.

01:28:52.125 --> 01:28:53.541
What did one shoe say to another?

01:28:54.541 --> 01:28:55.458
How should I know?

01:28:55.541 --> 01:28:57.708
Is that your footprint
or is it only my impression?

01:29:03.583 --> 01:29:04.625
Come on.

01:29:05.208 --> 01:29:06.541
So? Cool, isn't it?

01:29:07.583 --> 01:29:09.750
There you are, dude. Don't worry.

01:29:10.291 --> 01:29:12.458
There's what? Twenty people?
It's no big deal.

01:29:12.541 --> 01:29:14.000
Maybe less, okay?

01:29:16.250 --> 01:29:17.375
Come on, man!

01:29:18.333 --> 01:29:19.625
That way.

01:29:37.250 --> 01:29:38.250
Come on, come on!

01:29:40.916 --> 01:29:42.083
Let's go!

01:30:00.541 --> 01:30:01.541
Good evening.

01:30:05.583 --> 01:30:06.750
I'm Kang,

01:30:07.541 --> 01:30:11.166
and tonight is the first time
I've ever performed this song.

01:30:12.041 --> 01:30:13.500
It's called "K."

01:30:30.333 --> 01:30:33.500
<i>I pictured you differently</i>

01:30:35.875 --> 01:30:38.875
<i>But I like you better this way</i>

01:30:41.208 --> 01:30:44.208
<i>With highlights in your hair</i>

01:30:45.000 --> 01:30:49.958
<i>And eyes the color of the sea</i>

01:30:59.291 --> 01:31:01.291
Excuse me. Excuse me.

01:31:02.166 --> 01:31:03.125
Sorry. Excuse me.

01:31:03.208 --> 01:31:06.083
<i>The summers will pass</i>

01:31:08.500 --> 01:31:11.416
<i>We'll grow older</i>

01:31:13.916 --> 01:31:16.791
<i>You'll meet some guy</i>

01:31:17.916 --> 01:31:22.250
<i>He'll write you better songs</i>

01:31:23.166 --> 01:31:27.083
<i>And someday, I</i>

01:31:28.291 --> 01:31:33.208
<i>Will be a beautiful memory</i>

01:31:34.333 --> 01:31:37.750
<i>And all that will remain of this love</i>

01:31:39.541 --> 01:31:43.708
<i>Is a whisper in your ear</i>

01:31:46.791 --> 01:31:50.166
<i>If your heart races</i>

01:31:52.041 --> 01:31:55.083
<i>And you look strange in the mirror</i>

01:31:57.708 --> 01:32:04.000
<i>Even if you can't see anything
Follow my voice</i>

01:32:04.083 --> 01:32:07.166
<i>There is no darkness</i>

01:32:07.250 --> 01:32:09.750
<i>That can't be made light</i>

01:32:12.375 --> 01:32:15.333
<i>There is no darkness</i>

01:32:15.416 --> 01:32:20.166
<i>That can't be made light</i>

01:33:21.208 --> 01:33:25.500
<i>Before, I thought a lot about
everything I was missing out on.</i>

01:33:27.458 --> 01:33:31.375
But, actually,
what I missed the most was myself.

01:33:35.458 --> 01:33:39.833
And now that I've spent
76 days out of my room,

01:33:40.625 --> 01:33:41.916
everything is different.

01:33:43.625 --> 01:33:48.541
Thanks to the best family in the world
for reminding me who I am.

01:33:49.958 --> 01:33:52.500
You guys encouraged me
to go to therapy, and...

01:33:53.750 --> 01:33:55.333
and thanks to that, now I can see...

01:33:56.583 --> 01:33:58.750
what kind of landscape I am
and what kind I can be.

01:34:00.708 --> 01:34:03.916
And thanks to the people
who came into my life

01:34:04.625 --> 01:34:07.291
when I wasn't letting
anyone be a part of it.

01:34:08.333 --> 01:34:09.541
And to your voice.

01:34:10.500 --> 01:34:11.958
For always inspiring me

01:34:12.583 --> 01:34:17.583
and... helping me
to find the strength to be myself again.

01:34:22.625 --> 01:34:26.250
These paintings show how my life
has filled with color.

01:34:26.916 --> 01:34:30.791
How I found my own voice and...

01:34:31.666 --> 01:34:32.916
and decided to follow it.

01:34:37.333 --> 01:34:43.541
5. FOLLOW YOUR VOICE

01:34:43.625 --> 01:34:47.000
5. FOLLOW MY VOICE
